Package: ti-sgx-26.1-j721e-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Recommends: ti-sgx-26.1-j721e-ddx-um
Description: TI/Imagination PowerVR Rogue GPU kernel driver (DKMS) for J721E
 DKMS source for the TI PowerVR Rogue kernel module (pvrsrvkm), DDK
 26.1.6967606, configured for the J721E SoC GPU (GE8430, BVNC
 22.104.208.318) as found on the BeagleBone AI-64.
 .
 The module is built against the running kernel's headers at install time
 and rebuilt automatically by DKMS on kernel upgrades. It binds to the
 "ti,j721e-pvr" device-tree node, which the upstream powervr driver does not.
